6db-bb3e-4a4d-ad67-7f8ca2e71ba1","intoName":"CATERPILLAR INC FOREST PRODUCTS","why":"A second row of the same LaGrange plant (100 S L White Blvd), from another registry record with a point 5 km from the first. Now Weiler Forestry's, as above."},{"id":"40cc5be1-e3f8-4d78-99e9-40077aa21d45","from":"Ford","name":"FORD METER BOX CO INC","to":"Ford Meter Box","why":"A plant of The Ford Meter Box Company of Wabash, Indiana, a family-owned maker of waterworks products (founded by Edwin Ford, 1898): repair clamps, couplings, tapping sleeves and pipe restraints are made at Pell City. No connection with Ford Motor."},{"id":"15f054f3-8335-4df3-8cc6-6aa9fbbed26a","from":"Ford","name":"FORD MOTOR COMPANY","mergeInto":"71b3d071-f792-4a24-91e8-50346646684a","intoName":"Louisville Assembly Plant","why":"A second row of Louisville Assembly Plant (ours, 71b3d071-f792-4a24-91e8-50346646684a): the same address, 2000 Fern Valley Rd, at the point (38.15763, -85.72715) of the Kentucky permit records the EPA's registry holds for the plant; the row has no state."},{"id":"09be6653-17ce-4473-9118-e944b73fa3c1","from":"Ford","name":"FORD MOTOR COMPANY - LOUISVILLE ASSEMBLY PLANT","mergeInto":"71b3d071-f792-4a24-91e8-50346646684a","intoName":"Louisville Assembly Plant","why":"A second row of Louisville Assembly Plant (ours, 71b3d071-f792-4a24-91e8-50346646684a): same address and point as the row above; no state."},{"id":"e4547419-bdb7-4a2d-b3a8-0c85cebe634b","from":"General Motors","name":"CADILLAC PRODUCTS AUTOMOTIVE CO","to":"Cadillac Products","why":"a plant of Cadillac Products Automotive Company, an automotive supplier that is not General Motors"},{"id":"91065f86-12a6-41f7-b09e-9a8f7ff3a87b","from":"General Motors","name":"CADILLAC PRODUCTS","to":"Cadillac Products","why":"by its name a plant of the same Cadillac Products firm (we file it under Printing), on a street named Cadillac Parkway; not General Motors"},{"id":"f16ebf8a-f930-4151-9215-4acae338475e","from":"General Motors","name":"CADILLAC PRODUCTS PACKAGING CO","to":"Cadillac Products","why":"a plant of Cadillac Products Packaging Company (we file it under Plastics and Rubber Products), not General Motors"},{"id":"5a64ea4f-1695-42f8-90be-2e716edc04d0","from":"General Motors","name":"CADILLAC PLATING CORP","to":"Cadillac Plating","why":"Cadillac Plating Corporation, an independent zinc plating shop"},{"id":"852fa8e0-e146-4f1c-be84-38d24a0b9b34","from":"General Motors","name":"CADILLAC PLATING INC","to":"Cadillac Plating Inc","why":"by its name a plating shop of its own in Orange, CA (we file it under Fabricated Metal Products); not General Motors, and not the Warren, MI plater either as far as I can tell"},{"id":"d91ab6ca-7f10-4732-9a0f-aff8ae6f211d","from":"General Motors","name":"CADILLAC OIL CO","to":"Cadillac Oil","why":"Cadillac Oil Company, an independent maker of industrial lubricants"},{"id":"284fa05c-7924-455a-90d5-c7e31cca47df","from":"General Motors","name":"CADILLAC ENAMELING TECHNOLOGIES LLC","to":"Cadillac Enameling Technologies","why":"by its name an enameling shop of its own (the EPA has it as Cadillac Enameling Works Inc); not General Motors"},{"id":"6b0ac086-e436-4e4f-9997-b7548f21245e","from":"General Motors","name":"CADILLAC IRON INC","to":"Cadillac Iron","why":"by its name an ironwork maker of its own; not General Motors"},{"id":"a48e7bec-f579-4600-91e3-9f87843f6ebc","from":"General Motors","name":"AKWEL CADILLAC USA, INC","to":"Akwel","why":"Akwel's plant in the city of Cadillac, MI: Akwel is a French maker of car parts (fluid lines, mechanisms)"},{"id":"bb4b1023-65d4-4f5b-9377-5c0e0c15d9d1","from":"General Motors","name":"CADILLAC CASTING, INCORPORATED","to":"Cadillac Casting","why":"Cadillac Casting, Inc., a foundry in the city of Cadillac, MI; not General Motors"},{"id":"4389d5d6-8425-4e08-b40f-4eaeb3caa376","from":"General Motors","name":"CADILLAC FABRICATION","to":"Cadillac Fabrication","why":"by its name a metal fabricator in the city of Cadillac, MI; not General Motors"},{"id":"4f52b92b-1e77-4b49-a973-93b0f6d2e55b","from":"General Motors","name":"CADILLAC PRINTING COMPANY","to":"Cadillac Printing","why":"by its name a printer in the city of Cadillac, MI; not General Motors"},{"id":"84d4bc19-47a0-445e-8317-d55b82cbb887","from":"General Motors","name":"CADILLAC BROACHING & MACHINING IN C","to":"Cadillac Broaching & Machining","why":"by its name a machine shop near Cadillac, MI; not General Motors"},{"id":"24e53598-ff23-49d5-bd18-e3d556022b75","from":"General Motors","name":"BUICK RESOURCE RECYCLING FACILITY","mergeInto":"652f0a80-2354-4ed1-ac75-5475a793ec02","intoName":"BUICK RESOURCE RECYCLING FACILITY LLC","why":"The Doe Run Company's lead battery recycling plant at Boss, MO (Buick is the name of the old mine and smelter there, not the car)"},{"id":"9bc7f2f1-8b70-401c-bdad-c8b747256abf","from":"General Motors","name":"ALLISON TRANSMISSION DIV PLANT 12/14","to":"Allison Transmission","why":"part of Allison Transmission's main works in Indianapolis; Allison has been a company of its own since 2007"},{"id":"2231f3fa-b854-4d1a-935d-e4384ec24699","from":"Northrop Grumman","name":"NEW NGC INC (DBA NATIONAL GYPSUM CO)","to":"National Gypsum","why":"National Gypsum's plant at 1502 W North Carrier Pkwy (the EPA's record: industry 327420, gypsum products, active)."},{"id":"446a908c-0b04-43c4-8297-e044d56e4bfa","from":"Northrop Grumman","name":"NEW NGC INC","mergeInto":"970199e4-8f22-4377-98ac-303217c958e3","intoName":"National Gypsum Rotan","why":"National Gypsum's plant at 832 County Rd 311 (the EPA's record: industry 327420, active). We already list this plant under National Gypsum as 'National Gypsum Rotan' (970199e4-8f22-4377-98ac-303217c958e3), written from sources, 380 m away: the two rows are one plant."},{"id":"18619965-7a17-48a7-aadb-39eacf5763bf","from":"Raytheon","name":"RESY-W MAEHR RD/TSTC AMF","mergeInto":"775bf94f-3fa6-4ed0-b1bd-6cee079308b5","intoName":"L3Harris Waco","why":"L3Harris's aircraft modification plant at Waco (7500 Maehr Rd, at the TSTC airfield): L3Harris files it with OSHA as 'L3Harris AS IAS Waco', aircraft manufacturing (336411), 1,400 people in 2024 and in 2025. It was Raytheon's until L-3 bought Raytheon's Aircraft Integration Systems in 2002. We…"},{"id":"df2a4885-f1a4-433a-a858-9346362d8fe2","from":"Texas Instruments","name":"TEXAS INSTRUMENTS INC","mergeInto":"820ec88a-4f04-4ddc-b011-f4aa804c9cf3","intoName":"RAYTHEON TI SYSTEMS INCORPORATED","why":"A plant of TI's defense business (the EPA's record calls it Lewisville Defense Systems & Electronics), which TI sold in 1997; the Texas regulator's name for the site is now \"Raytheon Lewisville former Raytheon TI Systems\", and the Toxics Release Inventory holds TI's reports from it for 1987 to…"}]}$nt_data$::jsonb);
